Generate two courses of action that meet the doctrinal guidelines. Evaluate them against each other to select the best course of action and output your reasoning in the JSON. 

COA A: 
- blue-bridgehead holds its position to maintain a bridgehead.
- blue-screen moves to (8,6) to flank the red-riverline.
- blue-support moves to (7,8) to provide overwatch and support.

COA B: 
- blue-bridgehead holds to maintain the bridgehead.
- blue-screen moves to (8,6) to flank the red-riverline.
- blue-support moves to (7,6) to engage the red-town unit.

